msgid "Using C++ profilers"
msgstr "Próifíleoirí C++ a úsáid"

msgid ""
"To optimize Godot's performance, you need to know what to optimize first. To "
"this end, profilers are useful tools."
msgstr ""
"Chun feidhmíocht Godot a bharrfheabhsú, ní mór duit a fháil amach cad atá le "
"optamú ar dtús. Chuige sin, is uirlisí úsáideacha iad próifíleoirí."

msgid ""
"These profilers may not be the most powerful or flexible options, but their "
"standalone operation and limited feature set tends to make them easier to "
"use."
msgstr ""
"B'fhéidir nach iad na próifíleoirí seo na roghanna is cumhachtaí nó is "
"solúbtha, ach is iondúil go mbíonn a n-oibriú neamhspleách agus a sraith gné "
"teoranta níos éasca le húsáid."

msgid "Setting up Godot"
msgstr "Godot a bhunú"

msgid ""
"To get useful profiling information, it is **absolutely required** to use a "
"Godot build that includes debugging symbols. Official binaries do not "
"include debugging symbols, since these would make the download size "
"significantly larger."
msgstr ""
"Chun faisnéis úsáideach próifílithe a fháil, tá sé **ag teastáil go "
"hiomlán** tógáil Godot a úsáid lena n-áirítear siombailí dífhabhtaithe. Ní "
"binaries oifigiúla san áireamh siombailí debugging, ós rud é go mbeadh na "
"dhéanamh ar an méid íoslódáil i bhfad níos mó."

msgid ""
"To get profiling data that best matches the production environment (but with "
"debugging symbols), you should compile binaries with the ``production=yes "
"debug_symbols=yes`` SCons options."
msgstr ""
"Chun sonraí próifílithe a fháil is fearr a oireann don timpeallacht táirgthe "
"(ach le siombailí dífhabhtaithe), ba chóir duit binaries a thiomsú leis na "
"roghanna SCons ''production=yes debug_symbols=yes''."

msgid ""
"It is possible to run a profiler on less optimized builds (e.g. "
"``target=template_debug`` without LTO), but results will naturally be less "
"representative of real world conditions."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir próifíleoir a reáchtáil ar thógáil nach bhfuil chomh optamaithe "
"(e.g. ''target =template_debug'' gan LTO), ach ar ndóigh ní bheidh na "
"torthaí chomh hionadaíoch céanna ar dhálaí an tsaoil mhóir."

msgid ""
"Do *not* strip debugging symbols on the binaries using the ``strip`` command "
"after compiling the binaries. Otherwise, you will no longer get useful "
"profiling information when running a profiler."
msgstr ""
"Ná *not * stiall siombailí debugging ar na binaries ag baint úsáide as an "
"ordú ''stiall'' tar éis thiomsú na binaries. Seachas sin, ní bhfaighidh tú "
"faisnéis úsáideach próifílithe a thuilleadh agus próifíleoir á rith agat."

msgid "Benchmarking startup/shutdown times"
msgstr "Amanna tosaithe / múchadh tagarmharcála"

msgid ""
"See :ref:`doc_command_line_tutorial` for more command line arguments "
"supported by Godot."
msgstr ""
"Féach :ref:'doc_command_line_tutorial' le haghaidh níos mó argóintí líne "
"ordaithe le tacaíocht ó Godot."
